@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000

###  EVENTOS

### Listar todos os eventos
GET {{baseUrl}}/events

### Criar um novo Evento
POST {{baseUrl}}/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Teatro",
  "type": "TEATRO",
  "date": "2026-12-20T20:00:00",
  "startSales": "2026-01-01T08:00:00",
  "endSales": "2026-12-19T23:59:00",
  "price": 50.00
}

###  USUÁRIOS

### Listar todos os usuários
GET {{baseUrl}}/users

### Criar um novo Usuário
POST {{baseUrl}}/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Artur Linhares",
  "email": "artur@teste.com",
  "password": "1234",
  "city": "Itabira",
  "type": "CLIENTE"
}
###
PUT {{baseUrl}}/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "TESTE",
  "email": "teste@example.com",
  "password": "novaSenha",
  "city": "BH",
  "type": "ADMIN"
}

### VENDAS
### Realizar uma Venda (Comprar Ingresso)
POST {{baseUrl}}/sales
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "COPIE_UM_UUID_DE_USUARIO_AQUI",
  "eventId": "COPIE_UM_UUID_DE_EVENTO_AQUI",
  "saleStatus": "PAGO"
}

### Listar todas as Vendas
GET {{baseUrl}}/sales